		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Aquatic, squid-shaped qlippoth with four octopus arms, each ending in a pincer, and almost human eyes. 15 feet long, neon blue. Masters of domination.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 pincer +2 (1d4) or dominate, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Dominate</strong>. One creature within far WIS 15+ or qlippoth controls for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by cold iron or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Horrific Appearance</strong>. Mortal creatures looking directly at qlippoth, CON 15+ or 1d4 CHA damage. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
